        "original_id": "a447e2ba-3895-5411-9077-836af023fdbc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Radio Bam, Sirius Radio\n- People: Bam Margera, April Margera, Phillip \"Phil\" Margera\n- Topics: Jackass, Viva La Bam, CKY Videos\n\nFacts:\n- Radio Bam, also called Bam Radio, was a Sirius Radio station that aired on Mondays at 7 p.m.\n- Radio Bam frequently featured guest appearances by April Margera and Phillip \"Phil\" Margera.\n- Bam Margera is a Jackass reality television personality.\n- Bam Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.\n- Bam Margera was born on July 13, 1957.",
