        "original_id": "cd7dca70-13a5-5b21-a2ec-b2d67276b0f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bam Margera, Phil Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Brandon Novak, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, Chris Raab, April Margera, Don Vito\n- Organizations: CKY crew, Jackass crew\n- Products: Radio Bam, Viva La Bam, CKY Videos, Jackass\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Margera was born on July 13, 1957.\n- Phil Margera is an American reality television personality.\n- Phil Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY Videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, the show's supporting cast originally included Bam Margera's fellow CKY crew members Brandon DiCamillo and Brandon Novak, who appeared on most episodes.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, and Chris Raab made frequent guest appearances.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, April Margera, Phil Margera, Don Vito, and members of the Jackass crew also appeared.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
